                    copies of this memorandum to the members of the NSC, the Secretary of the Treasury, the Director of the Bureau of
                    the Budget, the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff, the Chairman of the
                    Atomic Energy Commission, and the Director of Central Intelligence.</p>
            </note>
